# Deeps03-qwen2-1.5b-log-classifier
# meta-llama-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct
# lmstudio-community-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3-GGUF
# mistralai-Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3
